sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application<br/>(Business Logic)
    participant Sidecar as AgentAuth Sidecar<br/>(Security Boundary)
    participant OPA as Policy Engine<br/>(Constraint Check)
    participant KMS as Key Management<br/>(Signing Oracle)

    Note over App, Sidecar: Mutualized Local Network (localhost)

    App->>Sidecar: POST /v1/sign (Payload)
    activate Sidecar
    
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: Load Active PoA
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Sidecar: Verification Phase
        Sidecar->>OPA: Eval(PoA.Constraints, Context)
        OPA-->>Sidecar: Allow/Deny
    end
    
    alt Policy Allowed
        Sidecar->>KMS: Sign(Hash(Payload)) [Auth: PCR0/Token]
        activate KMS
        KMS-->>Sidecar: Signature (Ed25519)
        deactivate KMS
        
        Sidecar->>Sidecar: Construct JWT/Proof
        Sidecar-->>App: 200 OK (Signed Token)
    else Policy Denied
        Sidecar-->>App: 403 Forbidden (Violation Details)
    end
    deactivate Sidecar
